Description: Support the current Debian GNOME Shell 51 API
 GNOME 51 removed Clutter.get_default_backend and the affectsInputRegion
 addChrome parameter. Use the stage context backend on new Shell versions;
 retain the old backend call on GNOME 46. The omitted chrome parameter had
 its default true value on GNOME 46. Update the native harness in the same way.
Author: Tomasz Iniewicz <84wholes_nozzle@icloud.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-20

